 "remarks": "THIS IS THE ONE YOU'VE BEEN WAITING FOR! Under constuction very close to completion. Brand new construction opportunity by highly regarded Lecher Development, on a prime, quiet in-town cul-de-sac. This exceptional luxury home offers 8000 + SF of high quality finishes, light-filled, living space across four finished levels. Highlights include:  Gourmet Kitchen: A state-of-the-art kitchen featuring a large center island, premium stainless steel appliances, and an open layout that flows seamlessly into the family room with a fireplace and French doors leading to a covered porch. Flexible Main-Level Living: The first floor includes a private main floor space that can serve as a home office or sixth bedroom, complete with a full bath. Finished Third Floor: Ideal for a second office, playroom, guest suite, or au pair quarters. Spacious Lower Level: Featuring 10-foot ceilings, full bath, plenty of options to crate the perfect gym, media room, playroom, or additional recreation space. Generous Ceiling Heights: 9-foot ceilings on the main and second floors enhance the home's open, airy feel. Additional amenities include a 24-kW generator, five-zone heating and cooling, town water and gas. Set on a level property with a designated pool site, this home combines luxury, comfort, and customization in an unbeatable location. Don't miss the opportunity to make this exceptional property your dream home",
